WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,180
I have broken up with the old Qin family.

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,500
Who dares to act wild again?

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,750
This is the end

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:15,720
Next time it won't be as simple as playing Teng, etc.

5
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,720
You broke the door

6
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,720
