8
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:30,500
Can't do Qin Tian well

9
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:36,280
Have you gotten up?

10
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,280
Captain Wang

11
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,280
so early

12
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:45,550
The relationship between your household registration and food

13
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,550
