16
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,550
The rations are still certified

17
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:52,550
Calculated in centimeters

18
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:53,550
Centimeters of the certificate

19
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:54,550
Otherwise, what will you eat?

20
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:55,550
